\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  cbank: more  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2  possible\b0\par\par\uc2 333 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 2011\par 15:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds comments from Polish radio interview)\par \par \uc2 * May \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more on \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  mkt, says cbank head\par \par \uc2 * C.bank does not target specific zloty level\par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON/WARSAW, Sept 24 (Reuters) - Polish authorities may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and debt markets if excessive volatility threatens the zloty \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Marek Belka said.\par \par \uc2 Warsaw launched an unprecedented two-pronged \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and debt markets on Friday to prop up the zloty and sovereign bonds, which were pummelled in the past week on a global investor exodus from risk.\par \par \uc2 "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decides there is a danger of severe volatility in the rate, it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Belka told Reuters on the sidelines of the International Monetary Fund/World Bank semi-annual meeting.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are possible and this is what happened ...It should not have been a surprise."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not targeting a specific level for the zloty, he said.\par \par \uc2 Following Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which drove up the zloty more than two percent against the euro, the bank said it had sold "a certain amount of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 " for zlotys, confirming earlier reports from dealers.\par \par \uc2 Belka would not reveal the size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but said the move was adequate and worked.\par \par \uc2 In an interview on Polish radio, the governor said that the bank does not target a specific zloty level. "I want those, who play for the zloty weakening, to know that there's a risk factor (involved)."\par \par \uc2 It was the bank's first move to support the zloty since April 9, 2010, and only the second since Poland adopted its free-float system for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The zloty had tested 27-month lows against the euro in recent days amid fears of a second global recession and fallout from the euro zone's worsening debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Lidia Kelly, Additional reporting by Dagmara Leszkowicz; Editing by John Stonestreet)\par \par \uc2 POLAND-BELKA/ INTERVIEW (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110927e79o000pq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
