\par\par \b \uc2 INSTANT VIEW 3-Polish c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to boost zloty\b0\par\par\uc2 472 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 2011\par 16:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW, Sept 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the zloty by selling "a certain amount" of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market.\par \par \uc2 The zloty had tested 27-month lows against the euro in recent days as investors fled riskier assets. The unit was more than 2 percent above Thursday's close after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It was the first \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the zloty since April 9, 2010 and only the second since Poland adopted its free-float system.\par \par \uc2 ANALYSTS COMMENTS:\par \par \uc2 GRZEGORZ MALISZEWSKI, CHIEF ECONOMIST AT MILLENNIUM BANK IN WARSAW:\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a surprise, it was not present directly on the market for a long time. Yesterday we had a verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor Marek Belka and it was backed by actions today. Today was a good moment because it is timed close to the session's end and liquidity is lower so smaller amounts can influence the zloty."\par \par \uc2 "I don't think this will strengthen the zloty permanently because the global sentiment remains negative. However, investors will now be aware that with significant weakening moves they should expect a market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 "I wouldn't pay attention to the level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and BGK want to defend. Direction and dynamics of the move were important, hence the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 CEZARY CHRAPEK, ANALYST AT CITIBANK HANDLOWY IN WARSAW:\par \par \uc2 "The recent comments by the finance minister, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor and Prime Minister Tusk confirmed the government's unhappiness with the large fall of the zloty and this raised the risk that the debt-to-GDP ratio would surpass 55 percent."\par \par \uc2 "After these comments, we could have expected that the finance ministry and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would soon begin to act, but it's surprising that they did it so quickly."\par \par \uc2 "They decided to show they can \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at any moment to reduce the zloty volatility and negative risks to inflation, the ratio of debt to GDP and for companies."\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decided that its better to show early that short-term investors cannot feel safe."\par \par \uc2 PIOTR BIELSKI, BZ WBK ECONOMIST IN WARSAW:\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a surprise, mostly because governor Belka numerously said that if someone counts on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  he will miscalculate.\par \par \uc2 "The bank wants to limit the volatility of the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . High volatility is bad both for the financial system and companies.\par \par \uc2 "There is no guarantee that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be succesful because we have a lot of uncertainty about the direction of the global economy. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wanted to show the market that it doesn't pay to overreact to global uncertainty."\par \par \uc2 BACKGROUND:\par \par \uc2 Polish zloty weakness is temporary-FinMin Rostowski\par \par \uc2 Polish PLN slide makes controlling CPI harder-Belka\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 POLAND\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (INSTANT VIEW 3)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110926e79n0012k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
