d by high levels of volatility and uncertainly on global markets, which she characterized as "a kind of shrapnel."\par \par \uc2 -By Marynia Kruk, Dow Jones Newswires; +48 22 447-2431; marynia.kruk@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 13, 2011 05:06 ET (09:06 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110913e79d001xm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
