\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Polish Central Banker, Finance Minister Face Down Traders\b0\par\par\uc2 502 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 2011\par 15:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Rewrites throughout, adding comments by Polish finance minister and analyst.)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Marynia Kruk \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--Poland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor and finance minister faced down \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders Friday, saying they refused to be pressured into \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the zloty, even as Warsaw-based dealers said state-owned Bank Gospodarstwa Krajowego has sold millions of dollars and bought the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The zloty weakened against the euro, the dollar and the Swiss franc Friday, but began strengthening on reports that BGK, which counts the finance ministry among its clients, was being more active on the market than usual.\par \par \uc2 Usually, BGK sells euros on a daily basis on behalf of the finance ministry, which receives them from the European Union for structural investments.\par \par \uc2 Peter Attard Montalto, an emerging market economist at Nomura, said the bank sold dollars to make more of impact and convince traders it was meant as an informal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Marek Belka effectively admitted \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  was playing a game of chicken with \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders when he said he refused to give speculators the satisfaction by getting drawn into a reaction to the zloty's sharp drop and warmed that "someone" could lose money.\par \par \uc2 "They're waiting for it [a verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ]," Belka told broadcaster TVN CNBC. "I'm not going to give them this pleasure."\par \par \uc2 Speaking at a regional economic forum, he said he didn't know what was driving the zloty's weakening, but that it had nothing to do with events in Poland.\par \par \uc2 "If someone is testing [us], that means they're trying to provoke us into some sort of reaction which will then be exploited in future rounds of speculative tests," Belka said. "No, no, no, we're just observing...someone is going to lose money."\par \par \uc2 His comments followed a similar statement by Finance Minister Jacek Rostowski.\par \par \uc2 "We will sell European Union structural funds when it's most inconvenient for markets, who are testing us, not when it's most convenient for them," Rostowski said. "Rather, we'll be testing them."\par \par \uc2 Analysts said the strenuous denials of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , combined with BGK's activity in dollars rather than euros, should be interpreted as a warning that the risks to those who are betting on the zloty's weakening are higher than when BGK first began its practice of converting euros on the market instead of with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "I still think we are in the danger zone for more sizeable \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from both the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and BGK," Montalto said.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for BGK declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 Poland's finance ministry and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  are loath to see a disorderly sell-off of the zloty, as it raises the likelihood Poland will breach its self-imposed 55% debt-to-gross domestic product limit this year, triggering automatic fiscal tightening.\par \par \uc2 -By Marynia Kruk, Dow Jones Newswires; +48 22 447-2431; marynia.kruk@dowjones.com [ 09-09-11 1300GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110909e799000zn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
